      "message": "fix(wire): keep the sharp-corner rest note on a tapered cut\n\nThe tapered generator wrote its own note list and dropped the\ncorner-rest note of the top-plane path. The verify line then did not\nsay the rest. The note is now carried over, marked with the top plane.\n\nAlso add `sharp_corners: false` to the two fixtures that upstream main\nadded since the PR branched (facet_tests.rs, wire_dxf_selection.rs).\n\nPinned by:\n- motion wire_edm::sharp_tests::a_tapered_sharp_square_die_keeps_its_corner_rest_note\n- app wire_sharp_corners::a_tapered_sharp_square_die_says_its_corner_rest_on_the_verify_line\n\nRefs #3207\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
